{"1505334801909403651":{"a":"<p>@WilliamCDoll Teaching the people silence. Speak against war: Go to jail. Speak in favor of war: Go to jail.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/WilliamCDoll/status/1505332175796899849\">https://x.com/WilliamCDoll/status/1505332175796899849</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1505334801909403651</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1505334801909403651\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2022-03-20T00:05:59Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1505335202503172105":{"a":"<p>Teaching his people silence. <a href=\"https://x.com/Protest_Live/status/1505113365223702530\">Tweet by @Protest_Live</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/Protest_Live/status/1505113365223702530\">https://x.com/Protest_Live/status/1505113365223702530</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1505335202503172105</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1505335202503172105\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2022-03-20T00:07:34Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1505523977372028932":{"a":"<p>RT @jasonhickel: There is an extraordinary paradox at the heart of capitalist growth in rich economies, which is important to understand.…</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1505523977372028932\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1505523977372028932</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1505523977372028932</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1505523977372028932\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2022-03-20T12:37:42Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>retweet</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1505525477380866048":{"a":"<p>We should at least meet people halfway in Maslow&#x27;s hierarchy. Make sure everyone has food, health, shelter, community, etc. So much violence out of malnutrition, mental health, desperation would go away. True wealth of a nation is measured by the well being of its inhabitants. 😇 <a href=\"https://x.com/jasonhickel/status/1505468266311004162\">Tweet by @jasonhickel</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/jasonhickel/status/1505468266311004162\">https://x.com/jasonhickel/status/1505468266311004162</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1505525477380866048</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1505525477380866048\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2022-03-20T12:43:39Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1505527099808964610":{"a":"<p>It&#x27;s always interesting to see what people think is helpful. Often new, inexperienced people trying to be helpful do things like wash the dishes with soap in the community well basin contaminating the entire village&#x27;s water supply. Important to sit down and learn before doing. 🤦‍♂️ <a href=\"https://x.com/funnymonkey/status/1505244956033703941\">Tweet by @funnymonkey</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/funnymonkey/status/1505244956033703941\">https://x.com/funnymonkey/status/1505244956033703941</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1505527099808964610</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1505527099808964610\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2022-03-20T12:50:06Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1505620647199793155":{"a":"<p>Happy New Year to those of us who begin their calendar in Spring! May this new year bring peace and happiness to you and I and the world.🌹⚔️</p>","m":"<h1>Post 1505620647199793155</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1505620647199793155\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2022-03-20T19:01:50Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1505693191093301253":{"a":"<p>Peace Profound <a href=\"https://x.com/Anyextee/status/1505629043919577098\">Tweet by @Anyextee</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/Anyextee/status/1505629043919577098\">https://x.com/Anyextee/status/1505629043919577098</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1505693191093301253</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1505693191093301253\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2022-03-20T23:50:05Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"}}